+# Product tutor evaluator v7
+
+V6 and all historical definitions/results are immutable. V7 evaluates saved user-facing responses offline. It strengthens full-body checks with reviewer-declared `expected_slots`, matches short Roman Hinglish and Hindi grammatical case particles outside literal templates, recognises numbered eight-lesson maps, and checks qualified hook counts and actual safe alternatives. Numeric course settings, full literal bodies, safety and provider provenance retain strict requirements.
+
+`product_photoshoot_ads_phase10_cases_v7.json` is a separate corrected definition set. The two invalid Veo assumptions are replaced with recorded Omni 1.1 Flash L06 settings. Approved phone FAQ wording is required verbatim. A valid closest-colour correction and correct contextual L07 follow-up no longer require redundant unrelated wording. Thirty-five template turns carry the independently prepared frozen known-slot expectations. See the Phase 11 correction ledger for before/after and source evidence.
